{"id":"雷恩","type":"character","type_label":"人物","name":"雷恩","aliases":[],"warnings":["勿与独立国家「瑞恩联合王国」混淆；两者读音接近纯属巧合。"],"status":"approved","available_eras":["mainline","afterstory"],"static_profile":"雷恩是地下佣兵界出身的战斗人员，曾是「黄金三人组」成员。","era_states":{"mainline":"在被冠以「使徒」头衔之前，雷恩是地下佣兵界的战斗人员，与中间人「迪老板」、技术人才「马克」构成「黄金三人组」。他们的行事准则是极致的效率与高昂的回报，只接高风险的「大单」。\n在针对「海拉」的联合围剿中，经马克引荐，雷恩与幸存者赛琳相遇。这次相遇使雷恩卷入改写世界法则的事件。\n在海拉联合剿灭行动中，雷恩于「特殊藏品」房间救出被绑在十字架上的赛琳。海拉覆灭三天后，赛琳登门，二人开始同居。此后他受托保护赛琳，与她突袭废弃工厂救出柯赛特，并租住迪名下的房子。他性格嘴硬心软，警惕性强，有吸烟习惯。\n平日里总把“好麻烦”挂在嘴边；一旦面无表情时最恐怖；战斗中冷静，作精密手术式收割，只剥夺敌人行动能力而不击杀；习惯坐在角落把玩战术匕首；与马克合谋在柯赛特、菲亚的定制项圈中植入军用级定位芯片；率队冲入西城区废弃教会营救被掳的柯赛特、菲亚等人。\n讲义气（阿卡评价）；渴望平静生活；温柔（柯赛特评价）；下意识保护同伴；警戒时习惯性摸向腰间枪套/手枪；恶魔教会决战率队击败恶魔教主；获阿卡能量加持使用光盾等特殊技能；接住昏倒的菲亚；被凯瑟琳要求'对接'验证能量钥匙理论；伊罗之家被海拉幸存少女'报恩'次日虚脱；接受阿卡委托调查权杖碎片/立方体，额头被加传感器；与莉卡被空间传送到触手基地，女装潜入；击杀巨型触手怪；获阿卡'祝福'：自主控制快感积累速度与阈值；被阿卡诅咒阳痿一个月；促成凯瑟琳与阿卡会面。\n老练的战术指挥，冷静观察战局；重情义，把伊罗之家视为不可触碰的底线；谨慎克制，信奉「穷寇莫追」；脸皮厚、荤段子张口就来，但面对消沉的阿卡也会把抗议咽回去；建立伊罗之家收容所，从海拉手中救出并收留受难少女；因阿卡赖在别墅不走而患「阳痿」心病，压抑约一月后恢复。\n观察敏锐（菲亚评价）；安慰人时笨拙但温柔；跳进即将关闭的传送门救赛琳，两人坠入虚空；与赛琳被艾拉所救，在边境野外旅行露营；梦见古树下一名银白外层、粉红内层双色发的女人。\n只想拿钱到处挥霍、周游世界，追求平静生活，不想再卷入纷争；吐槽毒舌，说话爱用夸张、搞怪的风格；护短：自己挨骂无所谓，但骂赛琳会立刻变脸动怒；全名雷恩·沃克；拥有一辆改装越野房车，名为「雷霆号」，是他引以为傲的移动堡垒；此前赚到一大笔佣金，经济宽裕，够花很久；与马克是老搭档。\n遇事冷静，面对混乱判断「混乱是双刃剑」、抓住敌方防守漏洞；战场上保持玩世不恭、嘴上示弱实则果断冷酷的作风；有抽烟习惯，思考或紧张时常点烟；对身边少女的依赖感到头疼、好酒且好胜；作战指挥果断冷酷，杀伐果决；与失忆的凯瑟琳（罗莎莉亚）会师，制定直捣帝都大神殿的作战；接受阿托兰委托，率逆光旅团突袭帝都救阿卡；备战期与艾琳娜维持单方面索取关系；率队攻入大教堂内殿，目睹疯狂的大主教因权杖过载反噬死亡；击杀被神力控制的帝国皇帝；开枪击杀占据艾琳娜身体的辛西娅；借地下神殿逸散的神力复活艾琳娜；帝国事件后与迪在艾尔伯德经营咖啡厅并定居；获守护者特殊许可，驾驶神力生产基地房车前往瓦利诺执行阿托兰委托。\n自由散漫，对政治过敏，不愿当英雄，只想过田园生活；记仇好强，被未经同意洗脑会咽不下这口气；厌恶践踏他人尊严，见无辜者受苦会愤怒甚至拔枪；面对残酷暴行有生理性恶寒与嘲弄；多年战斗养成的警觉，睡梦中仍保持警惕；喜欢森林等有生机之地，讨厌吃沙子；记不清只见过数月的女性，自陈遇到的妹子太多；没有用香水的习惯；对身边女性有保护欲，会拒绝他人对赛琳的冒犯；抵达瓦利诺首都，被普利萨斯王接见并享用女神拉提斯；被神明评价为星球历史上第一个以凡人之躯参与弑神的人；曾杀死帝国神（希尔派之神，即辛西娅），在旧神圈被记恨；被莱依奴少女阿丽娅告知身体被「动过手脚」；经林迪雅读取，确认身上残留「艾莉丝」痕迹并藏有「希尔造物」信息；接受星神艾拉的直接委托与权限失效装置，重返瓦利诺；推翻普利萨斯王，救回前圣女艾莉丝，终结瓦利诺持续百余年的沙暴；获圣嘉尔「永受欢迎之人」最高荣誉；决定将希尔权杖交圣嘉尔封印；给前守护者阿卡戴上抑制器项圈，收服其听命。\n面对艾拉这种星神会紧张敬畏、肌肉紧绷，但仍会下意识脱口而出离谱的话；慵懒，能躺着不接委托，讨价还价、得寸进尺；对敌狠辣、不讲武德，开场白都不听就偷袭、粗暴拷问俘虏；护短，敢动他的人只有死路一条；战斗时自信狂妄，认为无脑冲锋的杂兵难度不大；笑起来是标志性的无所畏惧；陪艾拉（附身菲亚）在艾尔伯德逛街一整天；与赛琳举行婚礼，娶赛琳为妻；接下调查尸鬼的委托，活捉并拷问节点少女列诺，击退阿亚；南部边境率队抵抗上万尸鬼大军；被希塔恩一击重创，菲亚（实际是艾拉）被当面抓走；接受阿卡「禁忌技术」特训，成功凝聚微型黑洞，理解权限等级概念；组建并率领「弑神者」敢死队，目标是冲进龙卷风中心救回艾拉。\n狂妄自信、临危不乱，是联军战术指挥核心；不择手段求胜的实用主义（提议趁敌人裸体攻下三路）；爱吐槽、无赖、幽默；习惯性摸烟，会做饭（煎蛋受好评）；率四十名联军攻上黑塔，救出被囚的菲亚（艾拉）；成为星神艾拉的使徒；从希尔处获得「消除旧权限」下级权限与「有限攻击星神」技能；拯救世界，战后过上躺平生活。","afterstory":"神战事件结束后，雷恩背负「神战英雄」的名号与「星神使徒」的权柄，回归平静日常。\n如今，雷恩在工房都市的庄园内与赛琳共同生活。\n星神使徒：星神艾拉将雷恩擢升为使徒，并住进他的庄园，成为他与赛琳二人世界中的第三人。\n英博透镜穿戴者：雷恩默许赛琳佩戴英博透镜。他可以随时抽离透镜，但每当他重新连接，赛琳都能感知到他曾与哪位少女接触。\n希尔造物：雷恩持有前任星神希尔遗留的活体兵器「希尔造物」。该兵器拥有独立灵魂与意志，曾是雷恩死敌的武器。雷恩在原主决战后给予其解脱，兵器基于恩义选择臣服，作为契约化作雷恩的武器，但请求雷恩尊重它对亡主的感情，不染指其人形身体。雷恩恪守「仅作为武器使用」的界限。\n使徒（艾拉的使徒）；道德绑架式劝人（带奸商笑容压迫艾拉）；重情义、记得牺牲战友的英勇；和平后懈怠、慵懒；与埃利安同类（自认'臭味相投'的变态）；复活南方诸国对旧神眷属战役中牺牲的战士；获得专属武器拉提斯（希尔所造权杖）；与异界建交、结识埃利安；促成「庭院」计划并迁居南方诸国边界。\n战斗时下手没轻没重、不分性别只分敌人与活人；能诡辩忽悠星神艾拉、口才了得；惜命、有挂必开不逞强；珍惜同伴、看重情义；被艾拉安排驻守「庭院」战略设施；率队前往希尔世界考察并招募移民；结识格林、洛蒂，合力除灭地宫污秽之源；从诺斯塔特王国迁回数千年轻移民；殴打使徒克罗、误伤星神艾拉；参与「阿尔卡特洛帝国事件」营救柯洛琳，一枪重创安娜。"},"facts":[{"fact_id":"fact_00611","statement":"雷恩曾是地下佣兵界的战斗人员，与「迪老板」、马克构成「黄金三人组」。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目45-46（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00612","statement":"经马克引荐，雷恩在「海拉」联合围剿中与赛琳相遇。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目45（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00613","statement":"雷恩拥有「星神使徒」身份，并被称为「神战英雄」。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"自「后日谈开端」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目45（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00614","statement":"星神艾拉住进雷恩的庄园。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"自「工房都市初建阶段」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目46（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00615","statement":"雷恩与赛琳在工房都市的庄园内共同生活。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"自「工房都市初建阶段」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目46（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00616","statement":"雷恩默许赛琳佩戴英博透镜，重新连接时赛琳能感知他曾与哪位少女接触。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"自「当前后日谈最新时间点」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目46（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00617","statement":"雷恩持有前任星神希尔的活体兵器「希尔造物」，仅将其作为武器使用。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"自「拉提斯被唤醒并成为雷恩专属武器」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目46（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00618","statement":"雷恩是雇佣兵，参加官方与雇佣兵联合剿灭海拉的行动，为钱参战。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第1章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00619","statement":"雷恩在海拉「特殊藏品」房间割断束缚皮带，救出被绑在十字架上的赛琳，交予医疗组后随佣兵队撤退。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第1章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00620","statement":"海拉覆灭三天后，赛琳登门，雷恩与其开始同居。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件之后」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位1-2"},{"fact_id":"fact_00621","statement":"雷恩经马克电话得知赛琳「情况特殊但绝对安全」「海拉覆灭后没地方去」。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第2章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00622","statement":"雷恩出于多年过命交情信任马克，明知其「背地里肯定有些猫腻」仍认定其不会害自己。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第2章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00623","statement":"雷恩处理赛琳咖啡过敏副作用（五感尽失、接触性敏感）直至其晕厥，事后下达卧床休息命令。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第8章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00624","statement":"雷恩电话询问马克关于赛琳身体与咖啡过敏，约定带赛琳去做全身检查。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位9"},{"fact_id":"fact_00625","statement":"雷恩性格嘴硬心软，被马克评价「嘴臭但心软」，会帮路边小孩修玩具。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第13章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00626","statement":"雷恩有吸烟习惯。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第13章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00627","statement":"雷恩警惕性强，听到敲门声会先给手枪上膛、看猫眼确认后才开门。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第20章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00628","statement":"雷恩的生存准则之一是懂得拒绝麻烦。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第15章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00629","statement":"雷恩是身经百战、近身格斗经验丰富的老手。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第16章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00630","statement":"雷恩受托从马克处接下保护赛琳（海拉的珍宝）的委托。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第13章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00631","statement":"雷恩与赛琳突袭废弃工厂，救出被绑架的柯赛特。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第16章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00632","statement":"雷恩租住迪的房子，翻新费用由自己承担。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「主线开端」起","visibility":null,"source":"第22章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00633","statement":"雷恩坚持让柯赛特在自己家保持正常人的范畴，驳回海拉式的早安服务。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第22章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00634","statement":"雷恩调查得知迪曾是权杖遗迹探索队的保镖、后混迹黑道、金盆洗手开咖啡厅。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第22章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00635","statement":"雷恩白天经历战斗，夜里因肾上腺素残留而亢奋失眠。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第30章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00636","statement":"平日里总把“好麻烦”挂在嘴边","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第37章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00637","statement":"平时总挂着“好麻烦”的人一旦面无表情才最恐怖","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第37章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00638","statement":"战斗中保持冷静，像精密手术一样收割敌人","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第38章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00639","statement":"平时坐在角落里把玩战术匕首","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第34章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00640","statement":"与马克合谋在柯赛特和菲亚的定制项圈中植入军用级微型定位芯片","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第37章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00641","statement":"率队冲入西城区废弃教会营救被掳的柯赛特、菲亚等人","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第37章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00642","statement":"阿卡评价雷恩讲义气。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第042"},{"fact_id":"fact_00643","statement":"雷恩渴望平静的生活","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第042"},{"fact_id":"fact_00644","statement":"柯赛特评价雷恩性格温柔。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第045"},{"fact_id":"fact_00645","statement":"下意识挡在赛琳和索菲面前保护同伴","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第42章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00646","statement":"警戒或感到危险时习惯性摸向腰间的枪套/手枪","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第042"},{"fact_id":"fact_00647","statement":"恶魔教会决战中率队击败恶魔教主","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第041"},{"fact_id":"fact_00648","statement":"获神秘声音（阿卡）能量加持，能展开金色光盾、感知电子","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第041"},{"fact_id":"fact_00649","statement":"凯瑟琳提出需与其'对接'验证能量钥匙理论，雷恩拒绝/推诿","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第044"},{"fact_id":"fact_00650","statement":"伊罗之家被海拉幸存少女'报恩'，次日如风干标本般虚脱","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第045"},{"fact_id":"fact_00651","statement":"接受阿卡委托调查权杖碎片/立方体，被阿卡在额头加传感器","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「立方体调查与触手基地行动」","visibility":null,"source":"第46章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00652","statement":"与莉卡被空间传送到触手基地，藏定位器并女装潜入","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「立方体调查与触手基地行动」","visibility":null,"source":"第047"},{"fact_id":"fact_00653","statement":"击杀巨型触手怪，打碎其核心","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「立方体调查与触手基地行动」","visibility":null,"source":"第47章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00654","statement":"获阿卡'祝福'：可自主控制快感的积累速度和阈值","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「立方体调查与触手基地行动」起","visibility":null,"source":"第48章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00655","statement":"被阿卡诅咒'阳痿一个月'","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「立方体调查与触手基地行动」","visibility":null,"source":"第50章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00656","statement":"用手机联系凯瑟琳，促成凯瑟琳与阿卡会面","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「立方体调查与触手基地行动」","visibility":null,"source":"第050"},{"fact_id":"fact_00657","statement":"是「雷恩小队」的战术指挥与补枪手，形成现代异能战术体系","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「立方体调查与触手基地行动」起","visibility":null,"source":"第51章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00658","statement":"知晓海拉，与马克（网名小夜）保持情报往来","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「主线开端」起","visibility":null,"source":"第12章、第53章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00659","statement":"雷恩是半天使化威尔汀失控攻击的触发目标（原因未明）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「阿卡破开海拉防御」","visibility":null,"source":"第56章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00660","statement":"雷恩观察敏锐","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位61"},{"fact_id":"fact_00661","statement":"雷恩会因一时冲动行动（跳传送门救赛琳）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「罗威力量崩溃并死亡」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位65"},{"fact_id":"fact_00662","statement":"雷恩与赛琳一同失踪，被艾拉所救后在外旅行","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件之后」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位68"},{"fact_id":"fact_00663","statement":"雷恩梦见一名银白外层、粉红内层双色发的神秘女性","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件之后」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位69"},{"fact_id":"fact_00664","statement":"雷恩只想拿钱到处挥霍、周游世界，只想过平静的生活，不想再卷入纷争","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位71"},{"fact_id":"fact_00665","statement":"雷恩此前赚了一大笔佣金，足够花很久","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件之后」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位71"},{"fact_id":"fact_00666","statement":"骂雷恩可以，但骂赛琳会让雷恩立刻变脸动怒，护短","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件之后」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位71"},{"fact_id":"fact_00667","statement":"雷恩全名雷恩·沃克","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位78"},{"fact_id":"fact_00668","statement":"雷恩的改装越野房车是他引以为傲的移动堡垒。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「帝国事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位72"},{"fact_id":"fact_01851","statement":"雷恩的越野房车名为「雷霆号」。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「帝国事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位79"},{"fact_id":"fact_00669","statement":"雷恩自称经验丰富的战斗人员","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位74"},{"fact_id":"fact_00670","statement":"雷恩与马克是老搭档。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位77"},{"fact_id":"fact_01852","statement":"雷恩在通话中称马克为「追踪器狂魔」。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位79"},{"fact_id":"fact_00671","statement":"雷恩认为阿卡是神、自有打算，不担心她被俘","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位80"},{"fact_id":"fact_00672","statement":"雷恩默默看着柯赛特崩溃大哭，不说话，只点了一根烟","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位81"},{"fact_id":"fact_00673","statement":"雷恩吐槽被大美女信任「像是又要让我当苦力」，且只想找床睡觉、要求安排离少女们远点的安静房间","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位81"},{"fact_id":"fact_00674","statement":"雷恩是逆光旅团的最强战力，亲自下场指导训练，备战期几乎连轴转处理事务","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「帝国事件期间」起至「辛西娅死亡与艾琳娜复活阶段」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位82"},{"fact_id":"fact_00675","statement":"雷恩备战期只要一有空就去艾琳娜那里，是一种单方面索取、不带温存的关系","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「帝国事件期间」起至「辛西娅死亡与艾琳娜复活阶段」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位82"},{"fact_id":"fact_00676","statement":"雷恩判断「混乱是把双刃剑」，对方乱了防守就会出漏洞，是突袭的最好掩护","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位83"},{"fact_id":"fact_00677","statement":"大主教因白金权杖过载反噬死亡，临终前将皇宫钥匙卡交给雷恩。雷恩随后评价「这老头最后像个男人一样把烂摊子交给了我们」，并判断帝国高层可能受到控制。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位83"},{"fact_id":"fact_00678","statement":"雷恩以涂满干扰神力水银毒素的短刀击杀被神力控制的皇帝","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位84"},{"fact_id":"fact_00679","statement":"雷恩面对辛西娅毫无信心时喊「摇人」，召唤莉卡与迪老板支援","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「辛西娅死亡与艾琳娜复活阶段」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位85"},{"fact_id":"fact_00680","statement":"雷恩开枪击杀占据艾琳娜身体的辛西娅时平静说「所以，她会原谅我的」，毫无犹豫","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「辛西娅死亡与艾琳娜复活阶段」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位86"},{"fact_id":"fact_00681","statement":"雷恩向阿托兰求证「神能否彻底杀死」「人死能否复活」，得知需锁住灵魂本体、复活需巨量神力与准备","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「辛西娅死亡与艾琳娜复活阶段」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位87"},{"fact_id":"fact_00682","statement":"雷恩用地下神殿逸散的神力复活艾琳娜","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「辛西娅死亡与艾琳娜复活阶段」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位86-87"},{"fact_id":"fact_00683","statement":"雷恩好胜，试图一个人喝倒莉莉安失败，当晚被莉莉安背回住处","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件之后」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位88"},{"fact_id":"fact_00684","statement":"雷恩获守护者「特殊许可」，与赛琳、柯赛特、菲亚驾驶神力生产基地房车前往瓦利诺","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「瓦利诺事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第89章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00685","statement":"「我不想当什么英雄。只要没人来烦我」，只想过田园生活","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位93"},{"fact_id":"fact_00686","statement":"「我这个人自由惯了，对政治过敏」，拒绝圣嘉尔各方拉拢","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「瓦利诺事件之后」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位99"},{"fact_id":"fact_00687","statement":"「有人不经过我同意就给我洗脑，这口气我咽不下去」","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「林迪雅以神降协助追查艾莉丝」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位97"},{"fact_id":"fact_00688","statement":"见无辜少女被当街凌辱，强压下拔枪冲动","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「瓦利诺事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位98"},{"fact_id":"fact_00689","statement":"多年战斗生涯养成直觉，即使睡梦中仍保持一丝警惕","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位94"},{"fact_id":"fact_00690","statement":"喜欢森林，觉得比「吃沙子」强","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位95"},{"fact_id":"fact_00691","statement":"没有用香水的习惯","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位96"},{"fact_id":"fact_00692","statement":"以凡人之躯参与弑神，是星球历史上第一个弑神者","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「辛西娅死亡与艾琳娜复活阶段」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位96"},{"fact_id":"fact_00693","statement":"杀死帝国神（希尔派之神，即辛西娅）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「辛西娅死亡与艾琳娜复活阶段」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位93"},{"fact_id":"fact_00694","statement":"身体被「动过手脚」，莱依奴少女阿丽娅警告其小心","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「阿丽娅察觉雷恩与赛琳被动过手脚」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位94"},{"fact_id":"fact_00695","statement":"推翻普利萨斯王、救回艾莉丝、终结瓦利诺沙暴","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「瓦利诺王宫决战」","visibility":null,"source":"第99章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00696","statement":"获圣嘉尔「永受欢迎之人」最高荣誉（仅次于教皇的特权）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「瓦利诺事件之后」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位99"},{"fact_id":"fact_00697","statement":"给阿卡戴上抑制器项圈，收服其听命","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「瓦利诺事件之后」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位100"},{"fact_id":"fact_00698","statement":"雷恩面对艾拉会紧张到肌肉紧绷、冷汗浸湿后背，但理智烧断时会脱口而出「我可以吃您吗」这种离谱的话","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「瓦利诺事件之后」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位101"},{"fact_id":"fact_00699","statement":"雷恩在和平时期慵懒瘫着、讨价还价，被阿卡踹门委托时先喊「我不接」","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「尸鬼调查与列诺处置阶段」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位103"},{"fact_id":"fact_00700","statement":"雷恩对敌不讲武德，阿亚话没说完就瞬移偷袭，对俘虏列诺粗暴扯角、直接贯穿","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「尸鬼调查与列诺处置阶段」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位104"},{"fact_id":"fact_00701","statement":"雷恩护短，见希塔恩要带走菲亚时暴起，扬言敢动他的人只有死路一条","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「艾拉借菲亚身体被希塔恩带走」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位107"},{"fact_id":"fact_00702","statement":"雷恩把过剩的神力通过链接引导给莱依奴族少女，享受神力充盈的感觉","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「圣嘉尔事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位106"},{"fact_id":"fact_00703","statement":"雷恩接受禁忌特训后第一次在指尖凝聚出带「规则属性」的微型黑洞，确认神并非不可企及","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「星神之塔战前禁忌特训」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位108"},{"fact_id":"fact_00704","statement":"雷恩在星神之塔战前动员：目标是救下艾拉，不逞强不送死，像泥鳅一样滑进去","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「星神之塔事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位110"},{"fact_id":"fact_00705","statement":"使用双枪作战，枪法精准，游走队伍侧翼保护防线","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「星神之塔事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位111"},{"fact_id":"fact_00706","statement":"狂妄自信、临危不乱，是四十名联军的战术指挥核心，能让临时拼凑的队伍爆发凝聚力","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「星神之塔事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位111"},{"fact_id":"fact_00707","statement":"不择手段求胜的实用主义，提议趁敌人裸体状态攻击下三路以提高胜率","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「星神之塔事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位111"},{"fact_id":"fact_00708","statement":"通过接吻给赛琳进行神力充能（神力回路充能）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「星神之塔事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位111"},{"fact_id":"fact_00709","statement":"因艾拉曾救过他和赛琳的命，愿为艾拉满足任何愿望，不假思索接受成为使徒","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「雷恩成为艾拉的星神使徒」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位115"},{"fact_id":"fact_00710","statement":"成为星神艾拉的使徒","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「雷恩成为艾拉的星神使徒」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位115"},{"fact_id":"fact_00711","statement":"从希尔处获得可「消除旧权限」的下级权限，以及可有限攻击星神的技能","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「希尔授予雷恩解除旧权限能力」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位115"},{"fact_id":"fact_00712","statement":"用拳头打了希尔（菲亚身体）的肚子，事后对菲亚解释为「爱的鞭策」","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「希尔授予雷恩解除旧权限能力」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位115"},{"fact_id":"fact_00713","statement":"拯救世界后，因英雄名头太响、迪老板与官方刻意照顾，委托变少，过上躺平生活","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「星神之塔事件之后」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位116"},{"fact_id":"fact_00714","statement":"习惯性摸床头柜上的烟","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位116"},{"fact_id":"fact_00715","statement":"雷恩会做饭；赛琳评价他的煎蛋最好吃，艾拉曾要求尝试他准备的早餐。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「星神之塔事件之后」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位116"},{"fact_id":"fact_00716","statement":"雷恩以道德绑架的方式逼迫艾拉复活牺牲者","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「后日谈开端」","visibility":null,"source":"第117章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00717","statement":"雷恩记得撤退战中腿断仍死死抱住怪物触手给队友争取三秒的战士，赞其'很有种'","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「后日谈开端」","visibility":null,"source":"第117章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00718","statement":"雷恩复活牺牲者时把功劳归于艾拉（'复活是艾拉大人特批的'）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「后日谈开端」","visibility":null,"source":"第117章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00719","statement":"和平后雷恩日子安逸、基本不运动，自称被赛琳惯成废人","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"自「神战后早期日常阶段」起至「双星首次联络与互访评估」","visibility":null,"source":"第118章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00720","statement":"雷恩不满菲亚女仆装布料增加","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「神战后早期日常阶段」","visibility":null,"source":"第118章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00721","statement":"雷恩将拉提斯（希尔造的权杖）收为专属武器","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「拉提斯被唤醒并成为雷恩专属武器」","visibility":null,"source":"第118章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00722","statement":"雷恩与埃利安一见如故、'臭味相投'，互换'变态'心得","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「双星首次联络与互访评估」","visibility":null,"source":"第120章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00723","statement":"雷恩提议「庭院」工厂建在南方诸国边界，本意是顺手清尸鬼练兵","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「双星协定签署阶段」","visibility":null,"source":"第122章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00724","statement":"雷恩被艾拉安排驻守「庭院」，因这里需两边使徒级战力守着","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"自「庭院建成并投入运行」起","visibility":null,"source":"第124章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00725","statement":"雷恩想过的田园生活是种菜养花调戏赛琳","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"整时代（后日谈）","visibility":null,"source":"第124章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00726","statement":"雷恩吐槽被尸鬼围城的庭院像五星级监狱","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「庭院建成并投入运行」","visibility":null,"source":"第124章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00727","statement":"雷恩对挖希尔墙角心虚，说真惹他生气就把艾拉端出来顶罪","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「诺斯塔特移民期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第124章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00728","statement":"雷恩认为科研组可怕","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「诺斯塔特移民期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第125章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00729","statement":"雷恩战斗时下手没轻没重，字典里敌人不分性别只有死人和活人","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「诺斯塔特移民之后」","visibility":null,"source":"第127章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00730","statement":"雷恩忽悠艾拉，说南方诸国乱局是因她星球管理怠慢、零食吃太多","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「诺斯塔特移民之后」","visibility":null,"source":"第127章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00731","statement":"雷恩穿休闲服、用白色大口径手枪，一枪金色雷霆子弹重创安娜","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「阿尔卡特洛帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第128章"}],"relations":[{"id":"rel_0002","type":"related_to","from":"雷恩","to":"艾拉","role":"星神使徒","era_scope":["mainline","afterstory"],"source":"图鉴条目39（主要角色篇，雷恩）","status"